  "contentHtml": "<p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">나루고 이명섭 수석교사님께 받았던 파일을 나름 수정해서 쓰고있는 파일입니다</span><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">이름이랑 반 내용은 지워놨어요</span><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">연구를 좀 하셔야&nbsp;사용하시기 편하실꺼에요 ㅠㅠㅎㅎ</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">번 시트의 활동명과 활동내용칸만 작성하시면 자동으로 합쳐집니다</span><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">번시트는 쓰시려면 함수를 좀 수정하셔야되요</span><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span  style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\"></span><br></p><p class=\"0\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DesFT%26dataid%3D2%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20191220152835&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile266.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F9949A94F5DFC6A021FB11E')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_etc_s.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> 생기부 엑셀파일 (양식).xlsx</a><